gle-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uvwEyHeRSvE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uvwEyHeRSvE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uvwEyHeRSvE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T18:57:59-08:00","id":1158742,"title":"","content":"IT. both the mini series and the new movie","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12759-sleepy","name":"Sleepy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T22:26:49-08:00","id":1158778,"title":"","content":"Way different genre than most, but Ocean's Eleven and Ocean's Thirteen. Why? They are character pieces. The core of the movies is how the ensemble plays off each other. They are about being tricky, clever, and cunning. As an arc, they are about coming together, becoming adopted family, and the lengths you'll go to for each other. And Vegas is a very Changeling place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T13:05:18-08:00","id":1160615,"title":"","content":"If you're willing to include TV shows, I recently started watching the British series <i>Skins</i>. It's a teen relationship drama, and its level of quality is somewhat uneven, but the kinds of head games its characters play with one another, the passions and conflicts they revolve around, and the frequent use of psychedelic settings are good fodder for changeling stories. The character of Tony, in particular, is a great way to model a Fairest who takes some steep hits to his Clarity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22980-robothedino","name":"robothedino","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-20T08:06:12-08:00","id":1160852,"title":"","content":"If you read Japanese manga or watch anime (on Crunchyroll or elsewhere) then I highly recommend <i>The Ancient Magus' Bride.</i><br /> <br /> Official description:<br /> &quot;Chise Hatori, 15 years old. Lost, without hope, and without family, she is bought for money \u2013 not by another person, but by a non-human sorcerer named Elias. Though she hesitates, she begins life anew as his apprentice and future wife.&quot;<br /> <br /> You could either see it as a very kindly and non-typical Durance, or-- my preference-- as the story of a special girl saved from slavery on the Goblin Market by an old and powerful changeling. Elias reads like someone who might have once been a Darkling in the Autumn Court, but who has grown so powerful that he's now well beyond any category.<br /> <br /> The locales are also fun and inspirational: In the first five episodes, Elias and Chise visit a magical workshop in London, a dragon nature reserve in Iceland, and the Kingdom of Cats (which happens to take residence in an unsuspecting European village).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13580,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan","user":"Hsienfan","date":". 11-27-2017, 01:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan","name":"Hsienfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T17:22:15-08:00","id":1162578,"title":"","content":"You know what I just realized? It may have entire over games designed around it, but <b>The Matrix</b> can be read as a Changeling movie. Neo is a Changeling who starts the movie trapped in Arcadia and has realized something is wrong. The Matrix itself is a domain in Arcadia, while the Machines are the gestalt Gentry that rules said domain. Morpheus' team are changelings raiding Arcadia and breaking out those still enslaved by the machines all the while pursued by Huntsmen in the form of the Agents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T18:03:25-08:00","id":1162587,"title":"","content":"I like <i>Star Trek: First Contact</i> as a changeling movie.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">During the series, Picard was abducted by the Borg, a Keeper's collective manifestation, who changed him inside and out to be more like them: Locutus of Borg. His fae-touched human crew, who made a promise of loyal service to their captain, free him from this fate. But the experience stays with him, until <i>First Contact</i>, when in a prophetic nightmare he sees the implants bursting back through his skin while looking into mirror space...or is it a vision of the past? or the future? Later, Lily, one of his Touchstones, pulls him back from the brink of a low Clarity decision that would have gotten his whole crew killed. This all starts when his Keeper--through the Huntsman that is the Borg Queen--shows up at Earth to recapture not just him but all humans.<br /> <br /> Picard even makes pledges! First, shouting \u201cThis far, no further!\u201d, he makes a vow to never again meet the Borg on <i>their </i>terms, but forevermore on his own--to transform himself from victim to vanquisher. Then later, his determination to destroy the Borg lands Data in hot water, and he then must make <i>another </i>pledge to clean up his own mess.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Meghan Fitzgerald | Onyx Path freelance writer &amp; developer</i><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>Changeling: The Lost developer</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#009999\"><i>Mage: The Awakening developer</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald","name":"Meghan Fitzgerald","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T04:49:28-08:00","id":1162688,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm sorry, I didn't mean to interrupt your quest! Captain Ahab has to go hunt his whale!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-27T10:24:08-08:00","id":1163047,"title":"","content":"The ending of Studio Ghibli's <i>The Tale of the Princess Kaguya</i> also comes to mind as a perfect depiction of the Wild Hunt.","